data/production/npm-critical-packages.txt

This file is a list of npm package names taken from the "critical" npm
packages pages of ecosyste.ms Packages
(https://packages.ecosyste.ms/critical?registry=npmjs.org), by ecosyste.ms.
ecosyste.ms publishes its data under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
Changes made: package names were extracted from the HTML pages, de-duplicated
and sorted one per line by tools/npm_critical_catalog.py. No other data from
those pages is kept.
Global Executables is not associated with ecosyste.ms.
Until this file is replaced with an npm-native catalog (tracked in issue
#109), this file is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 rather than the repository's
MIT License. See the ecosyste.ms section of docs/DATA_SOURCES.md.

